# INDEX.plan

PROJECT
Modular 3D voxel sandbox engine. SDL3 owns window/input; OgreNext renders;
JSON content; OpenSimplex worldgen; planned Jolt physics + Lua mod behaviour.
World coordinates are hierarchical and cubic in X/Y/Z.

READ FIRST ON EVERY AGENT RUN
1. INDEX.plan
2. docs/STATUS.md
3. docs/CODE_REVIEW_V10.md
4. docs/CODE_AUDIT.md
5. docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
6. docs/DATA_DRIVEN_AUDIT.md
7. docs/STATIC_ANALYSIS.md
8. git status
9. git log --oneline -10

